{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20260828/photo/bkn-20260828131850247-0828_00822_001_01p.jpg?20260828134618\"/><p>隆昌市發生地震。</p><p>四川內江市隆昌市周五（28日）下午1時13分發生黎克特5.1級地震，震源深度13公里。暫時無傷亡報告，重慶有震感。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T07:20:28.856257+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":74,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none"}}